\,).$" "The derivative of $f(x)$ is defined by\n\n$$\n\\displaystyle \\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}x}=\\lim_{h\\to \\,0}\\frac{f(x+h)-f(x)}{h}=\\lim_{h\\to \\,0}(\n$$\n{{field-1}} \n$-\\,h\\,).$"] [:db/cas 17592186235417 :question/problem "${f}^{′}(x)={lim}_{h\\to \\,0}(-2x-h)=${{field-1}}" "${f}^{′}(x)=\\lim_{h\\to \\,0}(-2x-h)=${{field-1}}"] [:db/cas 17592186235421 :question/problem "Find ${lim}_{x\\to \\,\\pi /4}f(x).$ If the limit does not exist, write \"DNE\" (without the quotation marks).\n\n                            \n                                    \n                                        \n                                            \n\n                                                \n\n                                        \n                                        \n                                        \n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n${lim}_{x\\to \\,\\pi /4}f(x)=$\n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n{{field-1}}" "Find $\\lim_{x\\to \\,\\pi /4}f(x).$ If the limit does not exist, write \"DNE\" (without the quotation marks).\n\n                            \n                                    \n                                        \n                                            \n\n                                                \n\n                                        \n                                        \n                                        \n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n$$\n\\lim_{x\\to \\,\\pi /4}f(x)=\n$$\n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n{{field-1}}"] [:db/cas 175921862354