(2x+1)}{h}\\right)"] [:db/cas 17592186537339 :answer/value "{f}^{′}(x)={lim}_{h\\to 0}\\left(\\frac{x-7(x+h)}{h}\\right)" "{f}^{′}(x)=\\lim_{h\\to 0}\\left(\\frac{x-7(x+h)}{h}\\right)"] [:db/cas 17592186537349 :answer/value "{f}^{′}(x)={lim}_{h\\to 0}\\left(\\frac{(x+h)+(-7x)}{h}\\right)" "{f}^{′}(x)=\\lim_{h\\to 0}\\left(\\frac{(x+h)+(-7x)}{h}\\right)"] [:db/cas 17592186537468 :answer/value "{f}^{′}(x)={lim}_{h\\to 0}\\left(\\frac{2(x+h)+1-(2x+1)}{h}\\right)" "{f}^{′}(x)=\\lim_{h\\to 0}\\left(\\frac{2(x+h)+1-(2x+1)}{h}\\right)"] [:db/cas 17592186537512 :answer/value "{f}^{′}(x)={lim}_{h\\to 0}\\left(\\frac{(x+h)+x}{h}\\right)" "{f}^{′}(x)=\\lim_{h\\to 0}\\left(\\frac{(x+h)+x}{h}\\right)"] [:db/cas 17592186537551 :answer/value "{f}^{′}(x)={lim}_{h\\to 0}\\left(\\frac{(x+h)+x}{h}\\right)" "{f}^{′}(x)=\\lim_{h\\to 0}\\left(\\frac{(x+h)+x}{h}\\right)"] [:db/cas 17592186537562 :answer/value "{f}^{′}(x)={lim}_{h\\to 0}\\left(\\frac{2x+1-(x+h+1)}{h}\\right)" "{f}^{′}(x)=\\lim_{h\\to 0}\\left(\\frac{2x+1-(x+h+1)}{h}\\right)"] [:db/cas 17592186537604 :answer/value "{f}^{′}(x)={lim}_{h\\to 0}\\left(\\frac{-7(x+h)-(-7x)}{h}\\right)" "{f}^{′}(x)=\\lim_{h\\to 0}\\left(\\frac{-7(x+h)-(-7x)}{h}\\right)"] [:db/cas 17592186537667 :answer/value "{f}^{′}(x)={lim}_{h\\to 0}\\left(\\frac{2x+1-(x+h)}{h}\\right)" "{f}^{′}(x)=\\lim_{h\\to 0}\\left(\\frac{2x+1-(x+h)}{h}\\right)"] [:db/cas 17592186537754 :answer/value "{f}^{′}(x)={lim}_{h\\to 0}\\left(\\frac{-7x-(x+h)}{h}\\right)" "{f}^{′}(x)=\\lim_{h\\to 0}\\left(\\frac{-7x-(x+h)}{h}\\right)"] [:db/cas 17592186537884 :question/worked-solution "The derivative ${f}^{′}(x)$ is given by the limit \n\n$$\n{lim}_{h\\to 0}\\left(\\frac{f(x+h)-f(x)}{h}\\right).\n$$\n\nSince $f(x)=-7x$,  we have that $f(x+h)=-7(x+h).$ Hence,  we get\n\n$$\n{f}^{′}(x)={lim}_{h\\to 0}\\left(\\frac{-7(x+h)-(-7x)}{h}\\right).\n$$" "The derivative ${f}^{′}(x)$ is given by the limit \n\n$$\n\\lim_{h\\to 0}\\left(\\frac{f(x+h)-f(x)}{h}\\right).\n$$\n\nSince $f(x)=-7x$,  we have that $f(x+h)=-7(x+h).$ Hence,  we get\n\n$$\n{f}^{′}(x)=\\lim_{h\\to 0}\\left(\\frac{-7(x+h)-(-7x)}{h}\\right).\n$$"] [:db/cas 17592186537953 :question/worked-solution "The derivative ${f}^{′}(x)$ is given by the limit \n\n$$\n{lim}_{h\\to 0}\\left(\\frac{f(x+h)-f(x)}{h}\\right).\n$$\n\nSince $f(x)=2x+1$,  we have that $f(x+h)=2(x+h)+1.$ Hence,  we get\n\n$$\n{f}^{′}(x)={lim}_{h\\to 0}\\left(\\frac{2(x+h)+1-(2x+1)}{h}\\right).\n$$" "The derivative ${f}^{′}(x)$ is given by the limit \n\n$$\n\\lim_{h\\to 0}\\left(\\frac{f(x+h)-f(x)}{h}\\right).\n$$\n\nSince $f(x)=2x+1$,  we have that $f(x+h)=2(x+h)+1.$ Hence,  we get\n\n$$\n{f}^{′}(x)=\\lim_{h\\to 0}\\left(\\frac{2(x+h)+1-(2x+1)}{h}\\right).\n$$"] [:db/cas 17592186541054 :question/problem "Evaluate ${lim}_{t\\to -4}\\frac{{t}^{2}-16}{{t}^{2}+4t}.$" "Evaluate $\\lim_{t\\to -4}\\frac{{t}^{2}-16}{{t}^{2}+4t}.$"] [:db/cas 17592186541065 :question/problem "Evaluate ${lim}_{x\\to 4}\\frac{{x}^{2}-2x-8}{{x}^{2}+x-20}.$" "Evaluate $\\lim_{x\\to 4}\\frac{{x}^{2}-2x-8}{{x}^{2}+x-20}.$"] [:db/cas 17592186541105 :question/problem "Evaluate ${lim}_{x\\to 3}\\frac{{x}^{3}-27}{2x-6}.$" "Evaluate $\\lim_{x\\to 3}\\frac{{x}^{3}-27}{2x-6}.$"] [:db/cas 17592186541129 :question/problem "Evaluate ${lim}_{x\\to 5}\\frac{{x}^{2}-5x}{{x}^{2}-8x+15}.$" "Evaluate $\\lim_{x\\to 5}\\frac{{x}^{2}-5x}{{x}^{2}-8x+15}.$"] [:db/cas 17592186545299 :answer/value "${lim}_{x\\to \\infty }f(x)=-2$ and ${lim}_{x\\to -\\infty }f(x)=2$" "$\\lim_{x\\to \\infty }f(x)=-2$ and $\\lim_{x\\to -\\infty }f(x)=2$"] [:db/cas 17592186545316 :answer/value "${lim}_{x\\to \\infty }f(x)=-\\infty $ and ${lim}_{x\\to -\\infty }f(x)=\\infty $" "$\\lim_{x\\to \\infty }f(x)=-\\infty $ and $\\lim_{x\\to -\\infty }f(x)=\\infty $"] [:db/cas 17592186545325 :answer/value "${lim}_{x\\to \\infty }f(x)=-2$ and ${lim}_{x\\to -\\infty }f(x)=-\\infty $" "$\\lim_{x\\to \\infty }f(x)=-2$ and $\\lim_{x\\to -\\infty }f(x)=-\\infty $"] [:db/cas 17592186545334 :answer/value "${lim}_{x\\t